title: Ignacy Daszyński
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, centrist
card-image: img/portraits/DaszyńskiIgnacy.jpg
view-if: daszynski_advisor = 1
new-page: true

= Ignacy Daszyński

Daszyński ia the co-founder of the PPS and was the brief and first prime minister of independent poland. He is an excellent orator known for his attracting speeches.

- @clear_agenda
- @party_discipline
- @emergency_fundraising
- @mediate_coalition
- @cabinet
- @root: Return to main

@clear_agenda
title: Clear the agenda
subtitle: Removes all cards from the hand.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 6;
if (Q.difficulty >= 0) {
    window.dendryUI.dendryEngine.state.currentHands['main'] = [];
} else {
    window.dendryUI.dendryEngine.state.currentHands['main.main_easy'] = [];
}
!}

All items from our agenda have been cleared.

@party_discipline
title: Party Discipline
subtitle: Reduce dissent across the party.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent -= 10; conservative_dissent -= 10; center_dissent -= 10; reformist_dissent -= 10
    
We have enforced party discipline to reduce dissent across all factions.

@emergency_fundraising
title: Emergency Fundraising
view-if: difficulty < 1
subtitle: An emergency infusion of resources.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; resources += dues

We have gained +[+ dues +] resources.

@mediate_coalition
title: Mediate Coalition Dissent
subtitle: Daszyński can mediate coalition dissent.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and pps_in_government and coalition_dissent >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if pps_in_government = 0 : The PPS isn't in the government. ?][? if coalition_dissent < 1 and pps_in_government = 0 : Our coalition partners are currently satisfied with our actions. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; coalition_dissent -= 1; coalition_dissent -= 1 if coalition_dissent >= 2

Daszyński has successfully reduced dissent in the government.

@cabinet
title: Cabinet
subtitle: Direct one of our ministries.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and pps_in_government
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if pps_in_government = 0 : The PPS isn't in the government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6

Daszyński can direct our ministries.

- #cabinet
